    "relaxation and focus (L2, untested)": "that hearing beats slow to stillness, or a cascade climbing, relaxes or focuses a listener has not been measured. Test it: record ECG and respiration during silence and during playback, then compare `beats` (HRV) and `coherence` (RSA) between them."
